  {
    "episode_id": 83198,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83198.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "Well, it's very clear to me that Biden and the Democrat policies are to blame for the high gas prices. I mean, just look at this chart. And it shows that as soon as Biden and the Democrats took one-party Democrat control, The gas prices started soaring and it wasn't until later on that the war actually broke out. So I know that Biden and the Democrats know that this is a number one polling issue throughout the nation and so they wanted to deflect blame. They wanted to deflect blame onto the oil and gas industries. They have a constant war against oil and gas industries and this Hearing today is just another reflection of their war against U.S. produced oil and gas.",
