    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83198.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "So in that vein, do you see the American people maybe responding to this claim that it's big oil or it's big business that is causing these gas prices? Do you think that they're responding with? That's just not true.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
