    "turn_text": "The Biden administration has a war against oil and gas. made in America. The Trump administration wanted more oil and gas to be produced in America because we want more Americans to have the great jobs. We want to be energy independent. We want to have the political power that comes along with that for national security that we don't have to rely on hostile adversaries for our oil and gas and our energy needs.",
